The {{nihongo|'''Honda Legend'''|ホンダ・レジェンド|Honda Rejendo}} is a series of [[V6 engine|V6]]-engined [[executive car]]s that was produced by [[Honda]] between 1985 and 2021, and served as its flagship vehicle. The Legend has also been sold under the [[Acura Legend]], [[Acura RL|RL]] and [[Acura RLX|RLX]] nameplates — the successive flagship vehicles of Honda's luxury Acura division in North America from 1986 until 2020.

